Mentioning spin-off projects in "joiku" article was too much, I agree. I
can make mistakes especially since everybody is watching/critisizing .enai
contributing.

However, in my opinion official Lojban includes not only xorlo, but also
dotside, kanpe and *camxes*. According to camxes
http://camxes.lojban.org/camxes/?text=3Dlo+ladru+joi+lo+ckafi+cu+kukte
parses so the rest of that article is obsolete in post-camxes Lojban.



